# Google Maps Platform API Key (NEVER commit your real .env file!)
#
# Quickstart for Prototyping (Zero Billing / No Cloud Project Required):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required) and accept the Demo Terms.
# 3. Click to generate/reveal your free Maps Demo Key.
# 4. Copy this file to .env and paste your key below.
#
# For Production:
# Create an API key in Google Cloud Console with HTTP referrer & API restrictions
# for Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), and Routes API.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
